Chocobo Raising: off by default (ZENITHDEV-241).

LSB turned it on by default, but the feature only came with Treasures of Aht Urhgan.
This sets the default. A live settings/main.lua that lists the key has to change it too.
---
diff --git a/settings/default/main.lua b/settings/default/main.lua
index d46eb6e901..fd5e74acbc 100644
--- a/settings/default/main.lua
+++ b/settings/default/main.lua
@@ -298,7 +298,7 @@ xi.settings.main =
 
     -- CHOCOBO RAISING
     -- GMs open the developer debug menu on the chocobo next to each VCS trainer.
-    ENABLE_CHOCOBO_RAISING = true,  -- true/false. Enable Chocobo Raising features.
+    ENABLE_CHOCOBO_RAISING = false, -- true/false. Enable Chocobo Raising features.
     DEBUG_CHOCOBO_RAISING  = false, -- true/false. Enable verbose debug logging for Chocobo Raising (visible by players).
 
     -- CHOCOBO RACING
